==============================================================================
glyph census of the rendered PDFs
==============================================================================
bundle : ..

This tool lists what is printed and flags what a machine can decide is
wrong. It does NOT decide whether a glyph means what the prose says it
means: two occurrences of one codepoint can carry two different
quantities, and the bytes are then correct in both places. Section D is
an instruction to read, not a result. See the module docstring for the
epsilon_n precedent in this bundle.

