D. manual review: look-alike pairs present in the same paper
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Both members of a pair appearing is not an error. It means a
distinction was drawn somewhere, and the question is whether the prose
uses it consistently: ϵ_m for the delivery margin and ε for the drift
rate is a real distinction; ε_n for both a noise term and a convergence
tolerance is not.

